{"title": "Disrobing Blinkstep", "pageid": 50526, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Disrobing_Blinkstep", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 2 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Bonus actions", "Bugs", "Teleportation actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Misty_Step.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Misty_Step.webp/300px-Misty_Step.webp, /w/images/3/30/Misty_Step.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Misty_Step.webp/300px-Misty_Step.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Misty_Step.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Disrobing Blinkstep</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 2 conjuration spell</a>. It allows the user to teleport anywhere within sight without triggering <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attacks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Opportunity Attacks\">Opportunity Attacks</a>, dropping their armor and clothing in the process.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nYou teleport to an unoccupied space you can see. However, your clothes do not teleport with you.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Very_Fast_Blinking\" title=\"Boots of Very Fast Blinking\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Shoes_Bard_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Very_Fast_Blinking\" title=\"Boots of Very Fast Blinking\">Boots of Very Fast Blinking</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/60px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/80px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Misty Step\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\">Misty Step</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When the user teleports, they drop <i>worn</i> items. Specifically, worn items on the left side of the character sheet: <a href=\"/wiki/Headwear\" title=\"Headwear\">Headwear</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cloak\" title=\"Cloak\">Cloaks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\">Clothing</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Handwear\" title=\"Handwear\">Handwear</a> – along with worn <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Clothing</a> on the right side of the character sheet – drop around the place they teleported from (see gallery below).\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapons</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Shield\" title=\"Shield\">Shields</a> are not deemed clothing by the game and remain equipped on use. Additionally, worn <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing#Shoes\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Shoes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing#Underwear\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Underwear</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulets</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a> remain on the user, as do The <b>Boots of Very Fast Blinking</b> themselves.</li>\n<li>The user does <i>not</i> drop any wearable items which are not equipped. If the user removes their equipment prior to using these boots, they can use this variation of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/38px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/50px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Misty Step\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\">Misty Step</a> without any additional drawbacks - aside from the potential benefits of any worn items removed beforehand.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Items dropped by this spell are tossed randomly in an approximate 1.5 meter radius around the place where the caster started. This may be prudent to consider if using this spell near ledges.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sorcerers are able to twin-cast disrobing blinkstep which allows them to select two teleportation positions. It is unclear if this has any effect aside from the caster teleporting to the second position.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Use in game</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 187.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 185.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Character_sheet.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Character Sheet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Character_sheet.png/278px-Character_sheet.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Character_sheet.png/417px-Character_sheet.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Character_sheet.png/556px-Character_sheet.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Character Sheet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Character_sheet.png/278px-Character_sheet.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"186\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Character_sheet.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Character Sheet</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 290.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 288.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Appearance_in-game2.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Appearance_in-game2.png/433px-Appearance_in-game2.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Appearance_in-game2.png/649px-Appearance_in-game2.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Appearance_in-game2.png/866px-Appearance_in-game2.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Appearance_in-game2.png/433px-Appearance_in-game2.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"289\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Appearance_in-game2.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210158\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2421/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27840/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12969/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1924/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1137129/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n104.53%   49.665     28 Template:Trim\n100.00%   47.512      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   47.512      1 -total\n 16.88%    8.022      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 15.98%    7.590      1 Template:Resource\n 15.30%    7.270      4 Template:Icon_text\n 12.5